## 1. Remove the competing meeting implementations

Do not keep the old service-account `googleMeet.ts` active alongside the OAuth provider.

Remove or stop importing:

- The service-account `getCalendarClient()` implementation.
- The hardcoded `markeroladipo@gmail.com` organizer fallback.
- The `organizer: true` attendee field.
- All `https://meet.google.com/new` fallbacks.
- Any frontend function that creates its own meeting directly.

There should be exactly one backend meeting-creation path.

